   "text": "FastAPI + LangGraph :8000\nHPA on CPU 70%\n\ncoordinator picks a spoke:\ndocuments \u00b7 calls\nmetrics \u00b7 general\n\nchats, sessions -> RDS\nuploads -> S3 documents\nLLM -> Bedrock (via NAT)",
   "originalText": "FastAPI + LangGraph :8000\nHPA on CPU 70%\n\ncoordinator picks a spoke:\ndocuments \u00b7 calls\nmetrics \u00b7 general\n\nchats, sessions -> RDS\nuploads -> S3 documents\nLLM -> Bedrock (via NAT)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
