   "text": "This picture is generated: edit scripts/diagrams/architecture.py, then make diagrams.\ncheck-docs.py [diagrams] fails when a repo in .gitmodules or a workload in\ninfra's chart is missing from it, or when this SVG was not rebuilt from the script.\nmake check and /realign run that check. Open architecture.excalidraw to zoom and pan.",
   "originalText": "This picture is generated: edit scripts/diagrams/architecture.py, then make diagrams.\ncheck-docs.py [diagrams] fails when a repo in .gitmodules or a workload in\ninfra's chart is missing from it, or when this SVG was not rebuilt from the script.\nmake check and /realign run that check. Open architecture.excalidraw to zoom and pan.",
